Package: sauerbraten-data
Architecture: all
Section: local/games
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, sauerbraten
Description: Sauerbraten's game data: maps, textures, models, sounds and music
 The data of the Sauerbraten 2020_12_29 ("2020 Edition") release, in
 /usr/share/games/sauerbraten: data/ (the scripts and menus) and packages/ (the maps and
 everything they use, the models, the sounds, the music). With the sauerbraten package
 (our cube2 engine and the menu entry) it is the game. It is separate from cube2-data, which
 is BananaBread's content.
 The licences are mixed and much of it is Creative Commons Attribution Non-Commercial or all
 rights reserved, so this package is for our own repository's licensed suite only
 (ps3-licensed), never a public one.
